Minimal line icon of {{SUBJECT}}, in the style of Lucide / Feather icons.
Reduce the subject to its 2 to 4 most recognizable parts and draw only those. Nothing else.

Style:
- Black outline strokes on a plain white background. No fill, no shading, no gradient, no color.
